repository-code: "https://github.com/vinodchandrass/agentic-ai"
url: "https://github.com/vinodchandrass/agentic-ai"

version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"

abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials supporting the systematic survey
  "Decision Validity in Agentic AI: A Systematic Survey of Validity
  Mechanisms Across Consequential Action Boundaries." The repository
  contains frozen screening records, the 58-record mechanism-focused
  evidence inventory, mechanism and boundary coding, quantitative
  synthesis outputs, robustness analyses, supplementary materials,
  and supporting verification resources.

keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - decision validity
  - assurance mechanisms
  - consequential action boundaries
  - evidence maturity
  - systematic survey
  - reproducibility
